==================================
INSTALL DOCKER FIRST
===================================
IN UBUNTU 
sudo apt update
sudo apt install docker.io -y
sudo systemctl enable --now docker
sudo docker --version
sudo docker info

IN KALI LINUX 

sudo apt update
sudo apt install docker.io -y
sudo systemctl enable --now docker
sudo docker --version
sudo docker info

===================================================
INSTALL APPLICATION  
====================================================
-Create a file or choose a file where to deploy
mkdir project
create the file with the name: install_sentinel_falco.sh


sudo chmod +x install_sentinel_falco.sh   
sudo ./install_sentinel_falco.sh [--enforce | --detect] 

   --enforce    real isolation of containers
   --detect     detection only (detect + alert, never isolate)
                (without either flag a reinstall keeps the previous mode; first install = detect)
   --port N     local API port (default 8080 or the one used by a previous install;
                Burp Suite / ZAP use 8080 on Kali: choose another one, e.g. --port 18080)
-----------------
if desire to activate isolation
sudo ./install_sentinel_falco.sh --enforce

======================================================
SIMPLE TESTING
======================================================
execute test 
   docker run -d --name victim -v /:/host alpine sleep 3600
   docker exec victim cat /host/etc/hostname
  sudo tail -n 3 /var/lib/Sentinel_Falco/alerts.jsonl

======================================
IF FALCO IS DOWN
======================================

sudo systemctl restart falco-guard



==================================
UNINSTALL
=================================

Removes everything install_sentinel_falco.sh creates: the guard, its 
virtualenv, the detection rules, the notification/cleanup services, the
token/config files, logrotate and the evidence/alerts data.

sudo ./uninstall_sentinel_falco.sh --yes
 --yes           skip the confirmation prompt
--purge-falco   also remove the falco package, its apt repo and keyring

======================================================
To check the logs 
======================================================
journalctl -u falco-guard -f
